---

This project interoperates with Samsung SmartThings/OCF appliances using
protocol knowledge and captured device fixtures from the open-source projects
mbillow/localthings and QuiteYellow/SmartThings-Local (both MIT). The captured
fixtures under test/fixtures/samsung/ retain their upstream attribution in that
directory's NOTICE.md. "Samsung" and "SmartThings" are trademarks of Samsung
Electronics Co., Ltd.; this project is independent and not affiliated with,
authorized, or endorsed by Samsung. The marks are used only nominatively to
identify the hardware and protocols this software interoperates with.
